^Another message...^

You know how I said 'See you at the end of the unit!'? Yeah. I lied. Either way, what I'm here to tell you is the you've probably started to notice some of the verb patterns in the present tense by now. If you haven't,  here they are:

* Nus ...ain
* Jau .../Jau ...a/ Jau...el (Jau has a few endings)
* Ti ...as
* Vus ...ais
* El/Ella ...a
* Els ...an

There are of course *loads* of exceptions to this, but those are the basic rules. From now on, we won't have any skills dedicated to _just_ present tense verbs, I'll just teach them whenever we need that specific verb